      "baseline": null,
      "condition": "long context; baseline text-based orchestration unspecified in front evidence",
      "source_locator": "Abstract, line 44"
    },
    {
      "claim": "Stateful execution achieves up to 7.63× reduced multi-agent latency at 16-agent scale (from abstract; workload and hardware conditions unspecified in visible evidence)",
